concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 789BB of amended Act applies to contracts entered into"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "after commencement (1) Section 789BB of the amended Act applies in relation to particular TCF work performed by a TCF contract outworker only if the contract for the provision of services, for the purpose of which the outworker performs the work, is entered into after commencement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "after commencement (1) Section 789BB of the amended Act applies in relation to particular TCF work performed by a TCF contract outworker only if the contract for the provision of services, for the purpose of which the outworker performs the work, is entered into after commencement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d858039712f96f16a5ddaf1b8b82eef707a3103fde018fb17eb429356cebd1c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Section applies after commencement" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.15" ;
