concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application of sections 149A and 155A of amended Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Sections 149A and 155A of the amended Act apply in relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after 1 January 2014, whether or not the award was made before that day." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 149A and 155A of the amended Act apply in relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after 1 January 2014, whether or not the award was made before that day."@en ;
