concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Application of power to give FWO notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Sections 712A to 712F of the amended Act apply in relation to an FWO notice given after this Part commences, whether the investigation to which the notice relates is begun before or after the commencement of this Part. 22  Application of amendments relating to self-incrimination etc. Section 713 of the amended Act applies in relation to information given, records or documents produced or questions answered after the commencement of this Part." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 712A to 712F of the amended Act apply in relation to an FWO notice given after this Part commences, whether the investigation to which the notice relates is begun before or after the commencement of this Part. 22  Application of amendments relating to self-incrimination etc. Section 713 of the amended Act applies in relation to information given, records or documents produced or questions answered after the commencement of this Part."@en ;
