    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of Subdivision A of Division 4 of Part 2-4 made by Schedule 2 to the Fair Work Amendment (Corrupting Benefits) Act 2017 apply in relation to a proposed enterprise agreement for which the access period under subsection 180(4) begins on or after the commencement of this Part.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment (Family and Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018  Part 8  Clause 39 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
