concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Resolving uncertainties and difficulties about interaction between"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "enterprise agreements and unpaid family and domestic violence leave (1) On application by an employer, employee or employee organisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made before the commencement of the Fair Work Amendment (Family and Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018, the FWC may make a determination varying the agreement:  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "enterprise agreements and unpaid family and domestic violence leave (1) On application by an employer, employee or employee organisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made before the commencement of the Fair Work Amendment (Family and Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018, the FWC may make a determination varying the agreement:  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3315ab08b44a90faf394759fe48c940728c62e82a47c96fd986cde21b276b505" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Provides for varying enterprise agreements on application by employer, employee or organisation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
