    skos:definition "(4) The employee may, in the notice under subclause (2), advise the employer of a change to the end date of the initial leave period, but only if the change is necessary to allow the employee to take the flexible unpaid parental leave for the number of days referred to in subclause (3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1ce6b0d6754de2b48dca7b9a41b5839b2dd2500e533358c9009343c6b145b395" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-43 ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employee may advise employer of change to leave period end date under certain conditions." ;
