    skos:prefLabel "44 Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: amended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021. amending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021. commencement means the commencement of this Part.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021  Part 10 Amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 2 Clause 45 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: amended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021. amending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021. commencement means the commencement of this Part.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment (Supporting Australia’s Jobs and Economic Recovery) Act 2021  Part 10 Amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 2 Clause 45 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
