    cof:title "51 Definitions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: amending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Paid Family and Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2022. deferred start day means the day after the end of the period of 3 months beginning on the day Schedule 2 to the amending Act commences. pre-commencement enterprise agreement means an enterprise agreement made before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the amending Act. small business employee means an employee whose employer was, on the day Schedule 1 to the amending Act commences, a small business employer (whether or not the employee was employed by the employer on that day)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 Entitlement to paid family and domestic violence leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "Non-small business employees (1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to an employee, other than a small business employee, whose employment starts on or after the commencement of that Schedule. (2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also apply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "Non-small business employees (1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to an employee, other than a small business employee, whose employment starts on or after the commencement of that Schedule. (2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also apply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ff9a2ee2aea7409db673a5ce193895c4c613adfe2c6e93d90336ba6886c5edac" ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-52-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-52-ss-2 ;
