doc:sch-1-sec-56 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56 Appeal of decisions of the Registered Organisations" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Commissioner Divisions 3 and 4 of Part 5-1, as amended by Division 2 of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, have effect as if a reference to a decision made under the Registered Organisations Act by the General Manager included a reference to a decision made under the Registered Organisations Act before the commencement of Division 2 of Part 1 of that Schedule by the Registered Organisations Commissioner (including a delegate of the Commissioner), other than a decision under subsection 293H(3) of the Registered Organisations Act.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay) Act 2022  Part 13 Amendments made by Part 4 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 3 Clause 57 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "52"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Objects of the Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 3 and 134 of the amended Act apply, after commencement, in relation to the FWC performing functions, or exercising powers, in relation to: (a) a matter that arises after commencement; or (b) a proceeding in the FWC that was on foot at commencement, or commences after commencement. (2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in relation to an annual wage review conducted in: (a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or (b) a later financial year.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 3 and 134 of the amended Act apply, after commencement, in relation to the FWC performing functions, or exercising powers, in relation to: (a) a matter that arises after commencement; or (b) a proceeding in the FWC that was on foot at commencement, or commences after commencement. (2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in relation to an annual wage review conducted in: (a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or (b) a later financial year.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c2cf1e45ab6ea9605c30dac13e0238f44d6166246bb62ee0f765c5b3a24ef387" ;
    cof:pageNumber "53"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.53" .
