    values:originalText "(2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in relation to an annual wage review conducted in: (a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or (b) a later financial year.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
