concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 Fixed term contracts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "Section 333E of the amended Act applies in relation to a contract of employment entered into on or after the commencement of Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act (whether or not a previous contract referred to in subsection 333E(4) of the amended Act was entered into before, on or after that commencement)." ;
    skos:definition "Section 333E of the amended Act applies in relation to a contract of employment entered into on or after the commencement of Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act (whether or not a previous contract referred to in subsection 333E(4) of the amended Act was entered into before, on or after that commencement)."@en ;
