concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-65 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65 Termination of enterprise agreements after nominal expiry date"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-65 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 12 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to an application for the termination of an enterprise agreement made under section 225: (a) on or after the commencement of that Part; or (b) before the commencement of that Part if, at that commencement, the FWC has neither terminated nor refused to terminate the agreement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by Part 12 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to an application for the termination of an enterprise agreement made under section 225: (a) on or after the commencement of that Part; or (b) before the commencement of that Part if, at that commencement, the FWC has neither terminated nor refused to terminate the agreement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3127cd6764c3112acadcf5c5c824a52eb847c476312a19914c088d8eba9c1ccb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "61"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments apply to termination applications made under section 225" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
