doc:sch-1-sec-65 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "65 Termination of enterprise agreements after nominal expiry date" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 12 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to an application for the termination of an enterprise agreement made under section 225: (a) on or after the commencement of that Part; or (b) before the commencement of that Part if, at that commencement, the FWC has neither terminated nor refused to terminate the agreement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    cof:pageNumber "61"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-66 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66 Genuine agreement in relation to enterprise agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-66 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the amendments made by Part 14 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, Part 2-4 continues to apply, as if the amendments had not been made, in relation to: (a) any proposed enterprise agreement for which the notification time occurs before the commencement of Part 14 of that Schedule; and (b) any variation of an enterprise agreement for which the employer’s request that affected employees for the variation approve the variation by voting for it occurs before that commencement.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay) Act 2022  Part 13 Amendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 12 Clause 67 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Despite the amendments made by Part 14 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, Part 2-4 continues to apply, as if the amendments had not been made, in relation to: (a) any proposed enterprise agreement for which the notification time occurs before the commencement of Part 14 of that Schedule; and (b) any variation of an enterprise agreement for which the employer’s request that affected employees for the variation approve the variation by voting for it occurs before that commencement.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay) Act 2022  Part 13 Amendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 12 Clause 67 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "907ef5a8f85fdc92d337ed8e18fe8950509de493278218e485754f92e4391f26" ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Continues application of Part 2-4 despite amendments made by Part 14 of Schedule 1." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.62" ;
