concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-70 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70 Serious breach declarations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-70 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the amendments made to the following provisions of this Act by Part 18 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, those provisions continue to apply, in relation to an application made under section 234 of this Act before that Part commences, as if the amendments had not been made: (a) Subdivision B of Division 8 of Part 2-4; (b) Division 4 of Part 2-5; (c) section 274; (d) section 413." ;
    skos:definition "Despite the amendments made to the following provisions of this Act by Part 18 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, those provisions continue to apply, in relation to an application made under section 234 of this Act before that Part commences, as if the amendments had not been made: (a) Subdivision B of Division 8 of Part 2-4; (b) Division 4 of Part 2-5; (c) section 274; (d) section 413."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c0985c7654b4416c6a0320c4124a4bf2750cddace17f4a0b597d30d0e87b03d8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from amendments for applications made before Part 18 of Schedule 1 commences" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
