concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-71 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71 Intractable bargaining declarations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-71 ;
    values:originalText "In making a declaration under section 235 of the amended Act, the FWC may have regard to conduct engaged in before or after the commencement of Subdivision B of Division 8 of Part 2-4 of the amended Act.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "In making a declaration under section 235 of the amended Act, the FWC may have regard to conduct engaged in before or after the commencement of Subdivision B of Division 8 of Part 2-4 of the amended Act.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d016e80a063f38e367dab0779a0937d9d622c43bb05554cf3d0b5adea98137c0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consider conduct before or after Subdivision B of Division 8 of Part 2-4 of the amended Act when making a declaration under section 235." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
