concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-77 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77 Effect of making a single interest employer authorisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-77 ;
    values:originalText "Paragraph 172(5)(b) of the amended Act, as inserted by Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, applies in relation to single interest employer authorisations on or after the commencement of that Part if the authorisation was made on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "Paragraph 172(5)(b) of the amended Act, as inserted by Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, applies in relation to single interest employer authorisations on or after the commencement of that Part if the authorisation was made on or after that commencement."@en ;
