concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-78c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78C Availability of scope orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-78c ;
    values:originalText "Despite the repeal of subsection 238(2) of this Act by Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, that subsection continues to apply after the commencement of that Part to proposed single-enterprise agreements in relation to which a single interest employer authorisation is in operation.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay) Act 2022  Part 13 Amendments made by Part 23 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 17 Clause 80A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Despite the repeal of subsection 238(2) of this Act by Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, that subsection continues to apply after the commencement of that Part to proposed single-enterprise agreements in relation to which a single interest employer authorisation is in operation.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay) Act 2022  Part 13 Amendments made by Part 23 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 17 Clause 80A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c5cfd04abb9f741152bad52c4c1485653f478b82c4cd2087c4c67f9cbc7f79e0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Single-enterprise agreements with single interest employer authorization continue to apply despite repeal." ;
