doc:sch-1-sec-82 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "82 Variation of cooperative workplace agreement to add employer" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "and employees Subdivision AC of Division 7 of Part 2-4 of the amended Act applies in relation to a variation of a cooperative workplace agreement, if the agreement was made after the commencement of that Subdivision.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
