concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-88 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88 Superannuation—reduction of employer’s liability to the extent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-88 ;
    values:originalText "of superannuation charge payments Subsection 149B(2), as inserted by Part 2 of Schedule 3 to the amending Act, applies in relation to an employer’s obligation to make superannuation contributions on behalf of an employee, whether the requirements of that subsection are satisfied before or after the commencement of that Part.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "of superannuation charge payments Subsection 149B(2), as inserted by Part 2 of Schedule 3 to the amending Act, applies in relation to an employer’s obligation to make superannuation contributions on behalf of an employee, whether the requirements of that subsection are satisfied before or after the commencement of that Part.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b0e62142fae1f51afd89f21f80f50670ab50e47f185943efab0e84acd78cfa07" ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer's obligation to make superannuation contributions on behalf of an employee is unaffected by the commencement of Part 2 of Schedule 3." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.79" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-88-norm .
