concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-94 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94 Application of section 149E of amended Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-94 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 149E (delegates’ rights terms) of the amended Act applies in relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after 1 July 2024, whether or not the award was made before that day. (2) However, a modern award is not invalid on or after 1 July 2024 only because it does not include a delegates’ rights term." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 149E (delegates’ rights terms) of the amended Act applies in relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after 1 July 2024, whether or not the award was made before that day. (2) However, a modern award is not invalid on or after 1 July 2024 only because it does not include a delegates’ rights term."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "53ff1cdd15ab3717d963f4fba26449c2c2b9e1a2c64f417fd3d61a447ee385ee" ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-94-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-94-ss-2 ;
