concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-96 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96 Application of section 205A of amended Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-96 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 205A (enterprise agreements to include delegates’ rights terms etc.) of the amended Act does not apply in relation to an enterprise agreement if: (a) before 1 July 2024, the employer concerned asks the employees to approve the agreement by voting for it; and (b) by that vote, the employees approve the agreement; and (c) the FWC approves the agreement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 205A (enterprise agreements to include delegates’ rights terms etc.) of the amended Act does not apply in relation to an enterprise agreement if: (a) before 1 July 2024, the employer concerned asks the employees to approve the agreement by voting for it; and (b) by that vote, the employees approve the agreement; and (c) the FWC approves the agreement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fc1a9c007b9c3d474de4d367d86cecf69bd04d7fc42528282ed67548aac4560" ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer must obtain employee approval for enterprise agreement before FWC approval." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.85" ;
