concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-98 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "98 Offence relating to failure to pay certain amounts as required"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-98 ;
    values:originalText "Subsection 327A(1) of the amended Act applies in relation to conduct that occurs after the commencement of Part 14 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, including conduct that occurs after that commencement that is part of a course of conduct that began before that commencement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "Subsection 327A(1) of the amended Act applies in relation to conduct that occurs after the commencement of Part 14 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, including conduct that occurs after that commencement that is part of a course of conduct that began before that commencement.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7336370263eeb9d1458215b4eae3b246ec0318b2b87088d15a05261a52009433" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to pay certain amounts as required is an offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
