concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "111C FWC to vary certain modern awards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-111c ;
    values:originalText "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award: (a) is made before commencement; and (b) is to be in operation on commencement. (2) The FWC must, by the day before commencement, make a determination varying the modern award to include a right to disconnect term. (3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on (and takes effect from) commencement. (4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as if it were a determination made under Part 2-3.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Main amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 16 Amendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5A Clause 111D Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award: (a) is made before commencement; and (b) is to be in operation on commencement. (2) The FWC must, by the day before commencement, make a determination varying the modern award to include a right to disconnect term. (3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on (and takes effect from) commencement. (4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as if it were a determination made under Part 2-3.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Main amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 16 Amendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5A Clause 111D Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f78cbc055a5e859902c696258b742913e201c14a0ba5872402408943575f2ca2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.100" .
doc:sch-1-sec-111c a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "111C FWC to vary certain modern awards" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award: (a) is made before commencement; and (b) is to be in operation on commencement. (2) The FWC must, by the day before commencement, make a determination varying the modern award to include a right to disconnect term. (3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on (and takes effect from) commencement. (4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as if it were a determination made under Part 2-3.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Main amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 16 Amendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5A Clause 111D Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

