doc:sch-1-sec-111d a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "111D Application of amendments to small business employers" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act do not apply in relation to an employer that is a small business employer on the day of commencement, or an employee of the employer, for a period of 12 months beginning on that day.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-112 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "112 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-112 ;
    values:originalText "Section 357, as amended by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, applies in relation to representations made on or after the commencement of that Part.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Main amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 16 Amendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 7 Clause 113 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Section 357, as amended by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, applies in relation to representations made on or after the commencement of that Part.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Main amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 16 Amendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 7 Clause 113 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6a9ab84849db92caa6615d9e414766b12acba83ae65bffd9da3c02df6ca17728" ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amendments" ;
