    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of section 557, conduct engaged in before that commencement cannot constitute the same course of conduct as conduct engaged in after that commencement.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 17 Definitions  Division 1 Clause 115 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
