doc:sch-1-sec-117-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "117(1) References to employees etc. in fair work instruments made" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This clause applies to a fair work instrument that: (a) was made before commencement; and (b) is in operation on or after commencement." ;
    cof:pageNumber "106"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-117-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "117(2) References to employees etc. in fair work instruments made"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-117-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A reference in the fair work instrument to an employee or an employer is taken, on and after commencement, to include a reference to an employee or an employer, as the case requires, within the meaning of section 15AA of the amended Act, and, to avoid doubt, does not include a reference to an individual in respect of whom an opt out notice has been given and not revoked.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 17 Transitional provisions  Division 2 Clause 118 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A reference in the fair work instrument to an employee or an employer is taken, on and after commencement, to include a reference to an employee or an employer, as the case requires, within the meaning of section 15AA of the amended Act, and, to avoid doubt, does not include a reference to an individual in respect of whom an opt out notice has been given and not revoked.  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act Schedule 1 Amendments made by Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 17 Transitional provisions  Division 2 Clause 118 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
