concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-119 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "119 Old Act applies to proceedings on foot as at commencement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-119 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Despite the amendment made by item 237 of Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, the old Act continues to apply, on and after commencement, as if that amendment had not been made, in relation to the following: (a) an application made, or proceedings on foot, as at commencement, other than an application or proceedings prescribed by the regulations; (b) an application for review of, or an appeal relating to, an application or proceedings referred to in paragraph (a) (whether the application for review was made, or the appeal  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Despite the amendment made by item 237 of Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, the old Act continues to apply, on and after commencement, as if that amendment had not been made, in relation to the following: (a) an application made, or proceedings on foot, as at commencement, other than an application or proceedings prescribed by the regulations; (b) an application for review of, or an appeal relating to, an application or proceedings referred to in paragraph (a) (whether the application for review was made, or the appeal  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "799439e0d9ce6c83f33bcec4fda7d81a372bf0e32b1df0cd6bf3729ab770a37e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Old Act applies on and after commencement, despite amendment." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.107" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-119-norm .
