    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "under workplace instruments etc. Section 333X (employer-funded paid parental leave—preserved if child is stillborn or dies) applies in relation to an employee if: (a) the stillbirth or death mentioned in paragraph 333X(1)(a) occurs on or after the commencement of section 333X; and (b) the employee would have had an entitlement to leave mentioned in paragraph 333X(1)(b); and (c) the entitlement arises other than under a contract of employment (regardless of whether the source of the entitlement was made before, on or after that commencement)." ;
