concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-129 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "129 Application provision—employer-funded paid parental leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-129 ;
    values:originalText "under employment contracts Contracts entered into after section 333X commences (1) Section 333X (employer-funded paid parental leave—preserved if child is stillborn or dies) applies in relation to an employee if: (a) the employee would have had an entitlement to leave mentioned in paragraph 333X(1)(b); and (b) the entitlement arises under a contract of employment; and (c) the contract is entered into on or after the commencement of section 333X.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act" ;
    skos:definition "under employment contracts Contracts entered into after section 333X commences (1) Section 333X (employer-funded paid parental leave—preserved if child is stillborn or dies) applies in relation to an employee if: (a) the employee would have had an entitlement to leave mentioned in paragraph 333X(1)(b); and (b) the entitlement arises under a contract of employment; and (c) the contract is entered into on or after the commencement of section 333X.  Schedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c76585feadf68b225d685b9ccbbbba2769fa4770928c3d5054f93e1efff19747" ;
    cof:pageNumber "115"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer-funded paid parental leave entitlement preserved if child is stillborn or dies." ;
