    values:originalText "In this Schedule: amending Act means the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012. doing a thing includes making an instrument. FWA (short for Fair Work Australia) means the body referred to in section 575, as in force immediately before the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act.  Schedule 3  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012" ;
