concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2A Transitional provision—when first variations of default fund"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2a ;
    values:originalText "term take effect (1) This clause applies to the first 4 yearly review of default fund terms of modern awards under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by Schedule 1 to the amending Act). (2) In the review, determinations under that Division (whether made under section 156H or 156J) varying the default fund term of a modern award: (a) must take effect at the same time; and (b) must not take effect before 1 January 2015.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3 Default superannuation (Schedule 1)  Part 2  Clause 2B Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "term take effect (1) This clause applies to the first 4 yearly review of default fund terms of modern awards under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by Schedule 1 to the amending Act). (2) In the review, determinations under that Division (whether made under section 156H or 156J) varying the default fund term of a modern award: (a) must take effect at the same time; and (b) must not take effect before 1 January 2015.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3 Default superannuation (Schedule 1)  Part 2  Clause 2B Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3796b15377b269b3f203a811fa4dfb813584dc85ebb68f5f1923b57b78b5bafd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "120"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2a-ss-2 ;
