    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subclause (2), a person holding office as a Deputy President of FWA immediately before the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act continues to hold office as a Deputy President of the FWC." ;
    cof:pageNumber "131"^^xsd:integer .

