concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-25-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25(4) Transitional provision—Deputy President"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-25-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subclause (3), a thing done before that commencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that commencement as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of subclause (3), a thing done before that commencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that commencement as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done."@en ;
