doc:sch-3-sec-25-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "25(4) Transitional provision—Deputy President" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subclause (3), a thing done before that commencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that commencement as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done." ;
    cof:pageNumber "131"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-25-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25(5) Transitional provision—Deputy President"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-25-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3): (a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, a Deputy President of FWA; or (b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or (c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to another FWC member. A determination under this subclause has effect accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3): (a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, a Deputy President of FWA; or (b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or (c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to another FWC member. A determination under this subclause has effect accordingly."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cc71f5edfd35b3e7396d50dad733f36c4d41d86e46526fa2d88ba772df5db9eb" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-25 ;
