doc:sch-3-sec-25-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "25(5) Transitional provision—Deputy President" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3): (a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, a Deputy President of FWA; or (b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or (c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy President of the FWC were a reference to another FWC member. A determination under this subclause has effect accordingly." ;
    cof:pageNumber "131"^^xsd:integer .

