concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-26-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26(5) Transitional provision—Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3): (a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, a Commissioner of FWA; or (b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to a Commissioner of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or (c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to a Commissioner of the FWC were a reference to another FWC member. A determination under this subclause has effect accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3): (a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, a Commissioner of FWA; or (b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to a Commissioner of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or (c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to a Commissioner of the FWC were a reference to another FWC member. A determination under this subclause has effect accordingly."@en ;
