doc:sch-3-sec-29-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "29(1) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The person holding office as the General Manager of FWA immediately before the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act continues to hold office: (a) as the General Manager of the FWC; and (b) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that remains immediately before that commencement.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3 Changing the name of Fair Work Australia (Schedule 9)  Part 9  Clause 30 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29(2) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-29-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of FWA, then, for the purposes of the operation of any law on or after that commencement, the thing is taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of the FWC." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of FWA, then, for the purposes of the operation of any law on or after that commencement, the thing is taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of the FWC."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9854291141154d7b4bcfdfc5db71e6dcb3a23cc6f86760cf19562f5d50437755" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29 ;
