doc:sch-3-sec-29-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "29(2) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of FWA, then, for the purposes of the operation of any law on or after that commencement, the thing is taken to have been done by, or in relation to, the General Manager of the FWC." ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29(3) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-29-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of subclause (2), a thing done before that commencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that commencement as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of subclause (2), a thing done before that commencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of Schedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that commencement as if it were done under that provision as amended. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done."@en ;
