concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Part 1 of Schedule 10 to the amending Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by Part 1 of Schedule 10 to the amending Act (which is about costs orders in court proceedings) applies in relation to proceedings commenced after the commencement of that Part.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3 Regulations  Part 11  Clause 32 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment made by Part 1 of Schedule 10 to the amending Act (which is about costs orders in court proceedings) applies in relation to proceedings commenced after the commencement of that Part.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3 Regulations  Part 11  Clause 32 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b62d382dd4aba8485b68044dcd171d2b11017fd65f9e7a522bc1fcfd9888849a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement of amendment made by Part 1 of Schedule 10 to the amending Act." ;
