concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Part 2 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to the taking of unpaid parental leave by members of an employee couple if the first taking of leave by either member of the employee couple occurs after the commencement of that Part." ;
