concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-8a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8A Schedule 3A to the amending Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-8a ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Schedule 3A to the amending Act apply in relation to a matter that arises before or after the commencement of that Schedule, whether or not a conference starts to be conducted in relation to the matter before or after that commencement.  Schedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by Schedule 3A to the amending Act apply in relation to a matter that arises before or after the commencement of that Schedule, whether or not a conference starts to be conducted in relation to the matter before or after that commencement.  Schedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013"@en ;
