concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Schedule 4 to the amending Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Application of amendment relating to sections 492 and 492A (1) The amendment made by item 7 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act applies in relation to interviews conducted and discussions held after the commencement of that item. Application of amendments relating to section 505A (2) The amendments made by items 12 and 13 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act apply in relation to the frequency of entry after the commencement of those items. Application of amendments relating to accommodation arrangements and transport arrangements (3) The amendments made by items 14 and 15 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act do not apply in relation to arrangements entered into before the commencement of those items.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013  Schedule 4 Consent arbitration for general protections and unlawful termination (Schedule 4A)" ;
    skos:definition "Application of amendment relating to sections 492 and 492A (1) The amendment made by item 7 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act applies in relation to interviews conducted and discussions held after the commencement of that item. Application of amendments relating to section 505A (2) The amendments made by items 12 and 13 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act apply in relation to the frequency of entry after the commencement of those items. Application of amendments relating to accommodation arrangements and transport arrangements (3) The amendments made by items 14 and 15 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act do not apply in relation to arrangements entered into before the commencement of those items.  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013  Schedule 4 Consent arbitration for general protections and unlawful termination (Schedule 4A)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "00da00d480228299a9d3a83400b0868f47ad343596195b272a222502fc7422dd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-9-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-9-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-4-sec-9-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
