    cof:title "10 Schedule 4A to the amending Act" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by Part 1 of Schedule 4A to the amending Act apply in relation to dismissals that take effect after the commencement of that Schedule. (2) The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 4A to the amending Act apply in relation to employment that is terminated after the commencement of that Schedule.  Schedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013" ;
    cof:pageNumber "145"^^xsd:integer .

