concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-5-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Part 5 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 5 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, so far as they concern proposed enterprise agreements, apply in relation to a proposed enterprise agreement if an employer agrees to bargain for the proposed enterprise agreement after the commencement of that Part." ;
